  "Only n_cells (a structural property of the fit) is reported from real rows; no accuracy, fairness or certificate value on real data was computed or inspected.",
  "HMDA (5 race groups): the fairness term 0.5 - Gini_s is negative wherever Gini_s > 0.5, and the official builder makes any node with impurity <= EPSILON a leaf. Realised cells at seed 0: F2 22/50, F4 4/10, F5 2/5, F6 2/3. F5 and F6 produce the identical tree on HMDA (checked: same features, thresholds, children), so for HMDA the grid has 5 distinct configurations. Adult realises the full k-bar for every configuration.",
